# CODEOWNERS — automatically requests review from the listed owners.
# Replace the placeholder team/user with your own before running the workshop.
# See Lab 05 and Lab 07 for how CODEOWNERS pairs with branch protection.
#
# NOTE: On a personal fork, an org team like the one below won't resolve, so a
# "Require review from Code Owners" rule can't be satisfied. Solo/fork learners
# should point these at their own @username, or skip the Code Owners rule (Lab 07).

# Default owners for everything in the repo.
*                       @your-org/workshop-maintainers

# The sample application and its tests.
/src/                   @your-org/workshop-maintainers
/tests/                 @your-org/workshop-maintainers

# CI/CD and repository automation.
/.github/               @your-org/workshop-maintainers

# The GitHub Pages website and workshop content.
/docs/                  @your-org/workshop-maintainers
